  unitName: Alvitr (EU)
  unitId: 750113
  unitNumber: 7032
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Alvitr is simple, honest,
    and as bright in spirit as she is in battle. She selects her warriors based on
    strength, but beauty and grace in their technique is often of great importance
    to her.
  summonDesc: Light will prevail through the darkness!
  fusionDesc: So bright! Is this my new strength?!
